cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this artifact package, please cite it as below."
title: "Belief-Claim Gap - Complete Research Artifact Repository"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Youssef Hamdi Zafan"
date-released: "2026-11-27"
license: "Apache-2.0"
url: "https://github.com/0xLAB-art/belief-tomography-artifact"
abstract: >-
  Complete research artifact repository for the manuscript "Measuring the
  Belief-Claim Gap: Disentangling Autonomous-Agent Beliefs from Security
  Certification" (IEEE TDSC single-anonymous review; the manuscript names its
  author, while deposit commits use the anonymous 0xLAB-art identity): frozen
  30-experiment program E1-E31 plus the post-freeze transcript-retained
  rerun E32, claims-evidence ledger, the full measurement-platform mirror,
  and the live-fleet VPS data export. The manuscript itself is distributed
  via IEEE.
keywords:
  - belief tomography
  - agent security
  - black-box measurement
  - deception
  - reproducibility
